cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or dataset, please cite both the paper and the archived
  release of this repository.
title: >-
  Robotic vision-based inspection for surface roughness estimation in wood — code,
  dataset and trained models
abstract: >-
  Code, image dataset, reference profilometry measurements and trained model weights
  supporting a multimodal convolutional neural network that estimates the surface
  roughness parameters Ra and Rz from grazing-light images of robotically sanded
  Chilean oak, acquired in a dual-robot sanding and inspection cell.
type: software
